    "text": "re-paying the same tax."
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "start_seconds": 8.43,
    "end_seconds": 11.68,
    "text": "MTRX sits between your team and the assistants you already"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "start_seconds": 11.68,
