    "text": "use."
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "start_seconds": 12.68,
    "end_seconds": 15.92,
    "text": "It remembers what matters, keeps them inside your rules, and"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "start_seconds": 15.92,
