    "text": "learns from what actually worked."
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "start_seconds": 17.54,
    "end_seconds": 20.46,
    "text": "That turns AI coding into a governed company capability."
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "start_seconds": 20.46,
